# <%= projectName %>

Micronaut CLI walking skeleton scaffolded by keel — hexagonal, mediator-driven.

## Layout

```
domain/
  kernel/      — Command, Handler, Mediator bases; depends on nothing
  contract/    — the public surface: GreetCommand (+ ports as they appear)
  core/        — RegistryMediator + the GreetCommand handler
application/
  cli/         — picocli + Micronaut: maps flags to commands,
                 dispatches via the mediator, and hosts the
                 composition root
infrastructure/  — driven adapters (arrives with the first real port)
```

## Run

```sh
./mvnw package
java -jar application/cli/target/application-cli-0.1.0-SNAPSHOT.jar hello --name World
```

## Test

```sh
./mvnw test
```
